	(text_box "CN1...CN6:\n\n  - If your Fans have an Internal Pullup: Do not bridge any of the\n    Connections\n\n  - If your fans do not have an internal pullup and need an Pullup to an 5V\n    Reference: Bridge CN2 & CN5\n\n  - If your fans do not have an internal pullup and need an Pullup to their\n    supply-voltage: Bridge CN1 & CN4\n\n  - If your fans do not have an internal pullup and can accept 5V PushPull\n    inputs: Bridge CN3 & CN6 and desolder R1 & R3"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 243.84 135.89 0)
